  {
    "name": "Bansh333",
    "affiliation": "Unknown",
    "traces": 3,
    "status": "HOSTILE",
    "notes": [
      {
        "text": "Section Chief Lewis and Agent Spirit traced and pursued. Individual fled in a vehicle. Lewis neutralized the individual. A crew of seven then returned with weaponized vehicles while awaiting for Trauma, and blew up the NetWatch Emperor, and threatened to murder both Lewis and Spirit if they did not pay for the damage to their vehicle as a result of the gunfire. Lewis then gave the individuals some corporate business shards before leaving.",
